  <rules>
    <rule name="Astartes" id="4166-d3e8-8b71-6641" hidden="false">
      <description>During each friendly PLAGUE MARINE operative’s activation, it can perform either two Shoot actions or two Fight actions. If it’s two Shoot actions, a bolt pistol, boltgun or PSYCHIC weapon must be selected for at least one of them. You cannot select the same PSYCHIC weapon more than once per activation.
Each friendly PLAGUE MARINE operative can counteract regardless of its order.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Disgustingly Resilient" id="5adf-c927-a6a5-f996" hidden="false">
      <description>Whenever an attack dice inflicts damage of 3 or more on a friendly PLAGUE MARINE operative, roll one D6: on a 4+, subtract 1 from that inflicted damage.</description>
    </rule>
  </rules>
